173️⃣ days📆 later⏭️, Paul🙋 called📣 the👑 local🏛️ Jewish✡️ leaders👥 together🤝. He🙋 told🗣️ them🫂, “My🫂 brothers🫂, I🙋 haven’t🚫 done🎬 anything🚫 against➡️ our🫂 people👥 or🔀 our🫂 ancestors’👴 customs📜. But💡 I🙋 was✅ arrested⛓️ in📍 Jerusalem🏙️ and🔗 handed🤲 over➡️ to➡️ the🌍 Romans🏛️.
